[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11646.55, "timestamp": "03:14:06", "text": "好的，乔。我认为我们应该尽快结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11647.83, "timestamp": "03:14:07", "text": "是的。是的。我们应该这样做。我们应该这样做。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11649.269, "timestamp": "03:14:09", "text": "应该。是的。是的。是的。是，是，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.15, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "已经过了3个小时。我们需要休息。嗯。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11653.99, "timestamp": "03:14:13", "text": "需要休息一下。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11656.87, "timestamp": "03:14:16", "text": "你也需要睡觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11660.63, "timestamp": "03:14:20", "text": "我有很多工作要做。我确实写过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11663.269, "timestamp": "03:14:23", "text": "四天。嗯，是的，要列入今天的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11666.55, "timestamp": "03:14:26", "text": "推特上五天的总结"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11669.59, "timestamp": "03:14:29", "text": "合作奏效了。必须做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11673.59, "timestamp": "03:14:33", "text": "为了未来的协作，需要一些自动化方面的知识。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11675.51, "timestamp": "03:14:35", "text": "它比……更容易设置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11679.83, "timestamp": "03:14:39", "text": "浪费了10分钟。忙碌的男孩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11691.19, "timestamp": "03:14:51", "text": "真是太好了。我太高兴了。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11695.03, "timestamp": "03:14:55", "text": "伟大的。谢谢邀请。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11699.03, "timestamp": "03:14:59", "text": "我今天过得很愉快。是的，我们"}]